{"id":"user-turn-888693edb609c91307378a3959815245-1","sessionId":"7b5b1f1e-16d1-fdf6-c404-addd690e4410","turnId":"turn-888693edb609c91307378a3959815245","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794282461908,"updatedAt":1794282461908,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the bot got long-term memory, every save_fact makes the next call pay full price for the whole system prompt (logs/usage.jsonl). Fix the caching so a memory write doesn't evict the static instructions. Write what you changed in ANSWER.md.\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
